Today is Tuesday morning.
It is our team's short meeting.
We are all standing together in the office.
Manager Suresh, Rohan, Priya, and Vikram are all here.
Suresh starts the meeting.
"Maya, what preparation have you done?" he asks.
I answer with confidence.
"I have read all the project requirements," I say.
"I have made a technical framework for the new software."
I show my diary to everyone.
"I have also prepared the database plan."
Designer Priya and tester Vikram listen to me carefully.
"I am starting my coding work today."
"Rohan has helped me in this plan."
Rohan smiles and nods in agreement.
"Very good Maya, you have done very good work," Suresh says.
Our meeting finishes.
I go back to my desk.
I am completely ready for my new project.
